  "interpretation_limits": [
    "The decree creates a preliminary flood-risk assessment framework; it does not itself prove that the first national assessment is complete.",
    "The methodology approval deadline is 2027-06-01 and the first national preliminary assessment deadline is 2028-12-31.",
    "Identified potentially significant risk areas are inputs to later hazard maps, risk maps and risk-management measures.",
    "This decree does not establish or measure operational alert issuance, delivery, receipt, comprehension, action feasibility or protective action.",
